    {
      "text": "The Queries Library allows you to save and later access multiple queries when viewing and analyzing your logs in the Agentic Security Operations Platform (Agentic SecOps Platform)."
    },
    {
      "text": "To access the Queries Library:"
    },
    {
      "item": "In the Agentic SecOps Platform Admin Portal, click Explore.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          51,
          59
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, click Logs.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          35,
          39
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Library.",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Queries Library appears.",
      "depth": 0,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can view the following information for each query:",
      "depth": 0,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Name: The name of the query.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          4
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Query Type: Whether the query was built using the basic or advanced query builder.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Category: The category of the query, if assigned.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          8
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Description: The description of the query.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          11
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Updated At: The latest date that the query was saved.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Updated By: The last person to update the query.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "heading": "Managing Saved Queries",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "After saving a query, you can manage it from the Queries Library. Click a query in the list to expand and view its contents."
    },
    {
      "text": "See image."
    },
    {
      "text": "When managing saved queries, you can perform the following actions:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Categorize Saved Queries",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can organize saved queries by assigning them categories.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To categorize saved queries:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Explore > Logs.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Library.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Queries Library window appears.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the queries you want to categorize from the list.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Category.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 4,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          14
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select a category from the menu to assign it to the selected queries. The category is assigned immediately.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 5
    },
    {
      "item": "Edit Saved Queries",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can edit queries to update their settings or adjust their configurations.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To edit a saved query:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Explore > Logs.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Library.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Queries Library window appears.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Choose one of the following methods:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "Hover over the query, and click the Edit icon.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          36,
          40
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select the query from the list, and click Edit on the toolbar.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          42,
          46
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Make the necessary changes to the query.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Save the query in one of the following ways:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 5
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Save to override the saved query configuration with the edited version.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "From the Save drop-down menu, click Save As New to save your changes as a new query.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          9,
          13
        ],
        [
          36,
          47
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Delete Saved Queries",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can delete saved queries that you no longer use.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Deleting a query doesn't trigger a warning message and deletes the query immediately.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To delete saved queries:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Explore > Logs.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Library.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Queries Library window appears.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Choose one of the following methods:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3
    },
    {
      "item": "To delete a single query, hover over the query, and click the Delete icon.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          62,
          68
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "To delete multiple queries, select the checkboxes of the queries you want to delete, and click Delete on the toolbar.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          95,
          101
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The query is deleted and removed from the library.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "heading": "Managing Query Categories",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "text": "You can categorize queries saved in the Queries Library to maintain an organized and easily accessible list."
    },
    {
      "text": "When managing query categories, you can perform the following actions:"
    },
    {
      "item": "Add a Category",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can create categories to organize your saved queries for easier management.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To create a new category for saved queries:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Explore > Logs.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Library.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Queries Library window appears.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click New Category.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          18
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "An untitled category is added to the left-side navigation.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Enter a name for the category and click outside the input field.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "The category can now be assigned to queries.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Edit a Category",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can edit query category names to keep them relevant and descriptive.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To edit a category name:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Explore > Logs.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Library.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Queries Library window appears.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, hover over the query category that you want to edit, and click the Edit icon.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          96,
          100
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Edit the query name and click outside the input field.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Delete a Category",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "You can delete categories to remove unused or redundant query categories.",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "To delete a category:",
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "item": "Go to Explore > Logs.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ],
        [
          16,
          20
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Library.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          13
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Queries Library window appears.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          19
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "In the left-side navigation, hover over the query category that you want to delete, and click the Delete icon.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 3,
      "strong": [
        [
          98,
          104
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "The Delete window appears.",
      "depth": 1,
      "strong": [
        [
          4,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Select a deletion option:",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 4
    },
    {
      "item": "Delete only the folder: Delete the category, but not the queries saved to it.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          22
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "Delete all: Delete the selected category and all queries saved to it.",
      "depth": 2,
      "strong": [
        [
          0,
          10
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "item": "See image.",
      "depth": 1
    },
    {
      "item": "Click Delete.",
      "depth": 1,
      "number": 5,
      "strong": [
        [
          6,
          12
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}
